cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this teaching ebook, please cite it as below."
title: "Machine Learning & AI for Neurologists"
abstract: >-
  Open-source teaching ebook on machine-learning and AI literacy for neurology
  and stroke. It emphasizes honest data splits, calibration, external
  validation, clinical utility, governance, and monitored use. Educational
  only: not medical advice, patient-specific decision support, device
  clearance, local policy, or institutional endorsement.
type: software
